      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Understanding the Importance of Idioms and Phrases"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Idioms cannot be understood through literal word-by-word interpretation; understanding context and tone is essential.",
        "Categorizing idioms into thematic groups such as success, effort, anger, and intelligence significantly improves retention.",
        "Tone recognition helps quickly eliminate incorrect options by classifying expressions as positive, negative, or neutral.",
        "Phrasal expressions and idioms are high-yield scoring sections in SSC and competitive exams when approached scientifically."
      ],
      "id": "yz9rc2k"
